<title>USA: Watauga, Texas won by Rauscher Pierce Refsnes.</title>
<headline>Watauga, Texas won by Rauscher Pierce Refsnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes Inc. said it won $11.370 million of Watauga, Texas, combination tax and revenue limited tax certificates of obligation, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.68 percent.</p>
</text>
